Cell["\<\
A pathway tagged as \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]noise\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
generates random noise if it receives an empty input, and clears all data if \
the input is non-empty.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0cc5bd65-2086-43ed-b370-b4aad70f330d"],

