Cell["\<\
Below is an item memory for sparse distributed representations (SDRs), using \
an explicit threshold setting. As no update rule is specified in the \
auto-associative memory component, the default \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]replacement\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is assumed. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e3b5c163-c93d-4a97-93e1-543c8310898f"],

